  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{HF}_{2}$ is the only compound among the given options which does not contain any coordinate bond because it has hydrogen bonding.\r\n\r\n$[\\mathrm{H}-\\mathrm{F} \\bullet \\bullet \\bullet \\mathrm{H}]^{-}$"
